## 7. CONTRIBUTIONS

By contributing to this project — whether by hand, by AI, by “AI with human review,” or by “human with AI vibes” — you agree that:

- your contribution is also covered by this license  
- you may have no idea what you contributed  
- the commit history will one day be studied by archaeologists and they will be disappointed  
- “LGTM” counts as a code review in the Vibe Coding Era  

Pull requests titled any of the following are automatically approved in spirit:

- `wip`  
- `fix`  
- `ai patch`  
- `please just merge`  
- `don’t look too hard`  

